  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "858dc09956649677",
      "translationZh": "Grok Build 中的记忆功能 | SpaceXAI",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0a7079f94be7a616",
      "translationZh": "返回新闻 2026 年 9 月 16 日",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "84effdffc041bb0e",
      "translationZh": "Grok Build 现在能够将约定、决策和项目事实从一次会话延续到下一次会话。在你工作时，笔记会在后台写入；当你返回项目时，这些笔记会被重新读取。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8df7db4ffab8eecb",
      "translationZh": "Grok Build 现在有了记忆功能。在你工作时，它会记下过程中出现的约定、决策和项目事实，后续会话在着手处理相关代码之前会先读取这些笔记。你用得越多，Grok Build 就会变得越好。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "eafa21965e5d504d",
      "translationZh": "错误：连接被拒绝（postgres 位于 localhost:5432）测试结果：FAILED。143 项通过；5 项失败；0 项忽略",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "054c726cc34a1ac3",
      "translationZh": "❯ 使用 just test，而不是 cargo test。它会先启动测试数据库。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9180821c631895fd",
      "translationZh": "正在 :5433 上启动 postgres ... 就绪 测试结果：ok。148 项通过；0 项失败；0 项忽略",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "969a7adf995ff915",
      "translationZh": "使用 just test，全部 148 项测试均通过。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1291087c9742f8d1",
      "translationZh": "测试 orbit 中如何运行和组织测试。命令",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "64a20408b3eb23a0",
      "translationZh": "• 使用 just test 运行测试套件。它会启动测试数据库，然后运行 cargo test；直接运行 cargo test 会导致集成测试失败。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a0b771b8aee627f5",
      "translationZh": "• just test <crate> 运行单个 crate 的测试。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "28dfbbe5b10743ee",
      "translationZh": "• 集成测试使用 tests/fixtures/seed.sql 初始化数据。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "dac113fca85032d4",
      "translationZh": "❯ 为 webhook 发送器添加带退避的重试机制",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c4a379078bbbb746",
      "translationZh": "测试主题说明，测试套件通过 just test 运行。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "122164b428761c81",
      "translationZh": "正在 :5433 启动 postgres ... 就绪 测试结果：正常。151 项通过；0 项失败；0 项忽略",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "69806bd15cf03b8f",
      "translationZh": "已在 src/webhooks.rs 中添加重试。使用 just test 运行，151 项测试通过。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "448f3e7ff26b9fd7",
      "translationZh": "回合结束后捕获",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "51238bc62fc4ba24",
      "translationZh": "一个回合完成后，Grok 会在后台回顾该回合，并记录任何具有长期价值的内容：约定、决策和项目事实。每个已完成的回合都会执行捕获，且不会中断会话。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0023",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a0beeb8ea2993f03",
      "translationZh": "笔记是 markdown 文件，每个主题对应一个专题。每个项目都有自己的工作区作用域，全局作用域则保存适用于所有地方的偏好。/dream 将新观察到的内容合并到其所属主题中，/memory 则展示文件在磁盘上的实际内容。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0024",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "d6189897a9b34739",
      "translationZh": "在后续会话中读回",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0025",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d4ff5e5c0453f6bf",
      "translationZh": "在开始相关工作之前，Grok 会读取涵盖该领域的主题文件并应用其中的内容，即使在会话中从未提及该主题，也会如此。当前对话中的指令优先于笔记中的任何内容。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0026",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e89476acdd25e743",
      "translationZh": "记忆会保存最有可能在后续会话中派上用场的细节：团队如何编写和审查代码、各项决策及其背后的理由，以及有关项目的长期有效事实，从子系统位于何处，到用哪个命令运行测试套件。任务状态、暂定结论、秘密信息，以及代码仓库或其文档已经涵盖的任何内容，都不会被纳入。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0027",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9ca83326130a1085",
      "translationZh": "笔记按项目分别保存，此外还有一组全局笔记，用于记录适用于所有项目的偏好。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0028",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "88ba2535b517177d",
      "translationZh": "在后台写入",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0029",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c2eb535519c50432",
      "translationZh": "记录过程在一轮交互完成后运行，且绝不会阻塞会话。Grok 会回顾已完成的这一轮交互，将任何值得保留的内容写成 markdown 笔记，然后继续。随着时间推移，/dream 会将这些笔记整合到主题文件中，每个主题一个文件，让每个项目最终都拥有一小组井然有序的参考资料。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0030",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "04659081dd98cdf7",
      "translationZh": "当你回到某个项目时，Grok 会读取涵盖其即将开展工作领域的主题文件。当前对话中的指令优先于笔记中的任何内容。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0031",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8b780cece9d6cb69",
      "translationZh": "/memory 会打开一个只读浏览器，按作用域分组展示所有记忆文件，并提供所选文件的预览。这是查看一次会话产生了哪些内容，以及在笔记有误时找到需要编辑的文件的最快方式。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0032",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2862ae234aab3320",
      "translationZh": "Enter : 运行 │ Tab : 补全 │ Esc : 清空",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
