    },
    {
      "id": "b0040",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d922f7b07deca077",
      "translationZh": "全局记忆索引 由 Grok 生成。请勿直接编辑此文件。主题",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0041",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b1782bf2c0fe015c",
      "translationZh": "• 回复偏好 — 用户希望答案和 PR 描述采用怎样的写法。（ topics/preferences.md ）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
